{
  "schema": 1,
  "about": "wgrender's build as data: CMakeLists.txt, tools/build_web_library.py and the bindings read it. Edited by hand; tools/check_rules.py checks sources against src/*.c. sources, include (-I) and system_include (-isystem: vendored headers) are relative to this file; std, opt and warn are the desktop builds' (gcc/clang spelling); desktop.<os>[-headless]: defines, libs by name (-l<name>, or <name>.lib for MSVC), macOS frameworks, and static (link the runtime statically with MinGW); web.<variant> (release or debug, then -webgpu for that backend, then -threads; the wasm32 preset of the same name): emcc's cflags for the library, program_cflags a program compiled against it must match, and ldflags.",
  "sources": [
    "src/wgr.c",
    "src/wgr_asset.c",
    "src/wgr_audio.c",
    "src/wgr_camera3d.c",
    "src/wgr_cgltf_impl.c",
